        "accent_color": "#4a6b57",
        "body": "",
        "body_mobile": "<p>Choobies feature a built-in, AirTag-compatible compartment designed to help parents quickly find a missing shoe when life gets chaotic. The compartment keeps the AirTag enclosed, secure, and comfortably away from the foot.</p>",
        "spec_text": "<p><strong>Wide, foot-shaped toe box</strong> — The widest part of a kids' foot is the toes. Ours is shaped to match: room to splay, grip, and balance, instead of squeezing toes toward each other.</p>",
        "spec_text_2": "<p><strong>5.5 mm flexible sole</strong> — Thin enough to read slope and texture through, so balance gets built.</p>",
        "spec_text_3": "<p><strong>Breathable knit upper</strong> — Reinforced exactly where kids destroy shoes: the toe they drag and the heel they crush.</p>",
        "spec_text_4": "<p><strong>One-pull heel tab</strong> — A wide opening and a single tab mean they get them on themselves.</p>",
